  "instructions": [
    "heat a large skillet over medium-high heat and add 1 tablespoon of oil.",
    "add the sliced onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "add the duck breast and cook until browned on both sides, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "add the chicken broth, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Bring to a boil.",
    "stir in the long-grain rice and cook until the liquid is absorbed, about 15-20 minutes.",
    "add the custard powder and stir to combine. Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "serve the pilaf hot, garnished with fresh herbs or a sprinkle of paprika."
